## Development

Define the action's inputs and outputs in `action.yml`, then implement its behavior in
`src/index.mjs` and cover it with tests in `src/*.test.mjs`. The input and output tables in this
README come from `action.yml`; after changing that metadata, run `pnpm readme` to update them.

Use `getInput()` to read inputs and `setOutput()` to write outputs. Both helpers are in
`../../common/src/utils.mjs` and format values for GitHub's runner environment and output files.
All actions share these helpers and their tests. GitHub runs the action on Node 24, so you don't
need a separate build step.
